 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "solidity-lean — a machine-checked Solidity semantics (SolidCore)",
  "excerpt": "**SolidCore** is an executable, machine-checked semantics of Solidity written in [Lean 4](https://lean-lang.org/). It typechecks, lowers, and *runs* real single-contract Solidity programs inside Lean, and its behavior is continuously validated against the reference toolchain: **pinned `solc` 0.8.35 + the real EVM** (via [Foundry](https://github.com/foundry-rs/foundry))."
 },
